        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 451721, Ridgemont Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ridgemont Sandcast Bronze Handleset features a covered deadbolt for a unique look. This rustic handleset is available in 3 beautiful finishes: flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze. This old world handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. The Ridgemont Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available with your choice of interior trim lever or knob for a truly personal look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Sandcast Bronze Ridgemont Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Ridgemont Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-450721-specifications.pdf?v=1704262355\"><b>Emtek 451721 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
